<path d="M5 4 H17 a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 V20 a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2 H7 a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2 V6 a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2"></path>
<path d="M9 4 V3 a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2 H17 a1 1 0 0 1 1 1 V4"></path>
<path d="M8.5 12 L11 14.5 L15.5 9"></path>
<path d="M8.5 17 H15.5"></path>
</svg>
<span class="eyebrow">BUYER / 04</span><h3>Procurement</h3>
<p>Send clear specifications and assess the manufacturing path before committing an order</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
