</div>
</article>
<article class="cat-card" data-od-id="cat-pants">
<div class="cat-media">
<img alt="Pants product reference" class="media-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/uploads/products/pants-manufacturer.webp"/>
<a class="cat-overlay" href="#inquiry">
<span>Review scope</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="cat-body">
