</div>
</article>
<article class="cat-card" data-od-id="cat-sportswear">
<div class="cat-media">
<img alt="Sportswear product reference" class="media-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/uploads/products/sportswear-manufacturer.webp"/>
<a class="cat-overlay" href="#inquiry">
<span>Review scope</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="cat-body">
<span class="eyebrow">05</span><h3>Sportswear</h3>
<p>Stretch-fabric and activewear programs with construction, reflective details, labels, and packaging review</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cat-card" data-od-id="cat-streetwear">
<div class="cat-media">
<img alt="Streetwear product reference" class="media-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/uploads/products/streetwear-manufacturer.webp"/>
<a class="cat-overlay" href="#inquiry">
<span>Review scope</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="cat-body">
