</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 04 / Production process (DARK) ─────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section dark" data-od-id="production-process" id="production-process">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="head-text">
<span class="eyebrow">From brief to bulk</span>
<h2>Make the <span class="hl-dark">Order Clear</span> Before Production Starts</h2>
<p class="lead">Each stage turns buyer input into a reference for the next stage. The approved sample becomes the basis for bulk manufacturing</p>
</div>
<div class="head-side">

</div>
</div>
<div class="steps-vertical" data-od-id="process-steps">
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="step-01">
<span class="step-num">01</span>
<div>
<h3>Send the Product Details</h3>
<p class="step-body">Share the category, quantity, target market, size range, price target, reference photos or tech pack, fabric idea, labels, packing needs, and delivery plan</p>
</div>
<div class="step-output">
<span class="out-label">Output /</span>
              Initial requirement set
            </div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="step-02">
<span class="step-num">02</span>
<div>
<h3>Confirm Materials and Workmanship</h3>
<p class="step-body">Review fabric weight and composition, color, handfeel, buttons, zippers, drawcords, stitching, lining, artwork, decoration, labels, and packaging</p>
</div>
<div class="step-output">
<span class="out-label">Output /</span>
              Agreed product specification
            </div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="step-03">
<span class="step-num">03</span>
<div>
<h3>Make and Review the Sample</h3>
<p class="step-body">Check fit, measurements, construction, fabric behavior, artwork placement, trims, brand details, and the overall product before bulk</p>
</div>
<div class="step-output">
<span class="out-label">Output /</span>
              Sample comments and revisions
            </div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="step-04">
<span class="step-num">04</span>
<div>
<h3>Approve or Revise</h3>
<p class="step-body">Adjust the measurements, materials, labels, artwork placement, packing, or finishing until both sides have the production reference</p>
</div>
<div class="step-output">
<span class="out-label">Output /</span>
              Approved sample standard
            </div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="step-05">
<span class="step-num">05</span>
<div>
<h3>Produce, Check, and Pack</h3>
<p class="step-body">Bulk work follows the approved sample through cutting, sewing, decoration, finishing, inspection, folding, packing, and shipment preparation</p>
</div>
<div class="step-output">
<span class="out-label">Output /</span>
              Shipment-ready order references
            </div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 05 / Factory evidence ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" data-od-id="factory-evidence" id="factory-evidence">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="head-text">
<span class="eyebrow">Factory evidence</span>
<h2>Show the <span class="hl">Production Work</span>, Not Unsupported Factory Promises</h2>
<p class="lead">This prototype makes room for real production-floor, sample-room, equipment, inspection, and packing evidence. Unknown company facts are intentionally not converted into claims</p>
</div>
<div class="head-side">
<a class="btn btn-ghost btn-arrow" href="#inquiry">Review production information</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="evidence" data-od-id="evidence-block">
<figure style="margin:0;">
<div class="evidence-media">
<img alt="Fabric cutting table and cutting equipment" class="media-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/uploads/factory/factory-cutting.webp"/>
</div>
<figcaption>Supplied factory reference / Visible cutting tables and production equipment. Capacity, location, ownership, and certifications remain to be confirmed</figcaption>
</figure>
<div aria-label="Evidence status checklist" class="status-list" data-od-id="evidence-status">
<div class="status-row">
<span class="status-tag">VISIBLE</span>
<span class="status-body">Cutting tables and equipment in the supplied image</span>
</div>
<div class="status-row">
<span class="status-tag">SUPPORTED</span>
<span class="status-body">Sample review before bulk manufacturing</span>
</div>
<div class="status-row">
<span class="status-tag">SUPPORTED</span>
<span class="status-body">Production and packing reference updates</span>
</div>
<div class="status-row pending">
<span class="status-tag">PENDING</span>
<span class="status-body">Verified location, capacity, equipment, and compliance data</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 06 / Manufacturing capabilities ────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" data-od-id="manufacturing-capabilities" id="manufacturing-capabilities">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="head-text">
<span class="eyebrow">Material to pack-out</span>
<h2>The Details That Shape the <span class="hl">Final Garment</span></h2>
<p class="lead">Decisions are reviewed as a connected product system. A fabric choice affects fit, decoration, workmanship, care information, and packing, not just handfeel</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="modules" data-od-id="capability-modules" id="capabilities-services">
<article class="module" data-od-id="module-material">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="module-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="2"></ellipse>
<path d="M5 6 V18"></path>
<path d="M19 6 V18"></path>
<path d="M5 18 a7 2.5 0 0 0 14 0"></path>
</svg>
<span class="eyebrow">01 / FABRICS</span><h3>Material Direction</h3>
<p>Review product use, composition, weight, color, handfeel, stretch, drape, and special material requirements</p>
<ul>
<li>Fleece and French terry</li>
<li>Jersey and cotton options</li>
<li>Woven shell and lining</li>
<li>Stretch and performance options</li>
</ul>
</article>
<article class="module" data-od-id="module-construction">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="module-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M17 3 L21 7 L8 20 L4 20 L4 16 Z"></path>
<path d="M15 5 L19 9"></path>
<path d="M14 14 Q10 16 5 21"></path>
</svg>
<span class="eyebrow">02 / WORKMANSHIP</span><h3>Construction</h3>
<p>Translate the silhouette into measurements, seams, pockets, closures, reinforcement, lining, and finishing instructions</p>
<ul>
<li>Fit and size review</li>
<li>Stitching and seam details</li>
<li>Pockets and reinforcement</li>
<li>Buttons, zippers, and drawcords</li>
</ul>
</article>
<article class="module" data-od-id="module-brand">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="module-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M3 12 L12 3 H21 V12 L12 21 Z"></path>
<circle cx="16" cy="8" r="1.2"></circle>
</svg>
<span class="eyebrow">03 / DECORATION</span><h3>Brand Application</h3>
<p>Match the decoration method and artwork placement to the garment, fabric, intended look, and order plan</p>
<ul>
<li>Screen printing</li>
<li>Heat transfer</li>
<li>Embroidery</li>
<li>Patches and artwork placement</li>
</ul>
</article>
<article class="module" data-od-id="module-finishing">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="module-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<rect height="14" rx="1" width="18" x="3" y="7"></rect>
<path d="M3 12 H21"></path>
<path d="M12 7 V17"></path>
<path d="M9 7 L12 4 L15 7"></path>
</svg>
<span class="eyebrow">04 / PRIVATE LABEL</span><h3>Finishing System</h3>
<p>Coordinate the visible and hidden brand details before packing instructions are finalized</p>
<ul>
<li>Woven, neck, size, and care labels</li>
<li>Hangtags, stickers, and barcodes</li>
<li>Polybags and folding rules</li>
<li>Carton labels and marks</li>
</ul>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 07 / Quality control (DARK) ────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section dark" data-od-id="quality-control" id="quality-control">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="head-text">
<span class="eyebrow">Quality control</span>
<h2>Know What <span class="hl-dark">Should Be Checked</span> Before the Order Ships</h2>
<p class="lead">Quality control should be understandable to a buyer working remotely. The checkpoints below focus on fit, appearance, branding, packing, and consistency with the approved product reference</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="steps-vertical" data-od-id="qc-points">
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="qc-01">
<span class="step-num">01</span>
<div>
<h3>Incoming Material Reference</h3>
<p class="step-body">Confirm fabric direction, color references, trims, and order details before cutting and assembly</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="qc-02">
<span class="step-num">02</span>
<div>
<h3>In-Process Workmanship</h3>
<p class="step-body">Review construction, measurements, stitching, placement, and visible issues while corrections can still be made</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="qc-03">
<span class="step-num">03</span>
<div>
<h3>Finished Garment Check</h3>
<p class="step-body">Compare fit, appearance, labeling, decoration, and key measurements with the approved sample and order notes</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="qc-04">
<span class="step-num">04</span>
<div>
<h3>Pack-Out Verification</h3>
<p class="step-body">Check label accuracy, folding, polybags, carton information, packing count, and requested reference photography</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="step-row" data-od-id="qc-05">
<span class="step-num">05</span>
<div>
<h3>Shipment Preparation</h3>
<p class="step-body">Align carton details and shipment document support with the buyer's delivery plan before goods leave production</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 08 / Packaging and delivery ────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" data-od-id="packaging-delivery" id="packaging-delivery">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="head-text">
<span class="eyebrow">Packaging and delivery</span>
<h2>Prepare the Order for the Buyer's <span class="hl">Next Handoff</span></h2>
<p class="lead">The delivery workflow begins before cartons are closed. Share the destination, target timing, warehouse or retail requirements, and the documents your receiving team expects</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pack-grid" data-od-id="pack-block">
<div class="pack-steps">
<article class="pack-step">
<span class="eyebrow">01 / BRAND</span><h3>Labels and Tags</h3>
<p>Confirm label files, care information, size identification, hangtags, stickers, and barcodes</p>
</article>
<article class="pack-step">
<span class="eyebrow">02 / UNIT</span><h3>Fold and Bag</h3>
<p>Define folding, polybag, insert, sticker, and presentation requirements for each unit</p>
</article>
<article class="pack-step">
<span class="eyebrow">03 / CARTON</span><h3>Pack-Out</h3>
<p>Specify carton marks, product mix, size breakdown, packing count, and handling notes</p>
</article>
<article class="pack-step">
<span class="eyebrow">04 / HANDOFF</span><h3>Shipment Support</h3>
<p>Review packing references, carton information, destination details, and requested document support</p>
</article>
</div>
<aside class="side-prompt" data-od-id="delivery-prompt">
<span class="eyebrow">Planning note</span><h3>No Fixed Delivery Promise Without an Order Review</h3><p><strong>Final timing and shipping method depend on the confirmed product, materials, quantity, packaging, destination, and buyer requirements</strong></p><p>Include the target market, destination, deadline, and packing or document needs in the initial inquiry so the delivery path can be assessed with the product plan</p>
</aside>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- ─── 09 / Inquiry form ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" data-od-id="inquiry" id="inquiry">
<div class="container">
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="form-side">
<span class="form-eyebrow">Start the conversation</span>
<h2>Send <span class="hl">Enough Detail</span> to Get a Useful Manufacturing Review</h2>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact-us/">Send project details</a></div>
<form method="POST" action="/api/inquiry" data-product="Custom clothing" data-wa-phone="8615733728976" data-wa-key="" class="inquiry-form" data-od-id="inquiry-form"><input type="hidden" name="product" value="Custom clothing" /><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Yauum inquiry — Custom clothing" /><input type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none" />
<div class="field">
<label for="garment-type">Garment type</label>
<select class="select" id="garment-type" name="garment_type" required="">
<option value="Hoodies" selected>Hoodies</option>
<option value="T-Shirts">T-Shirts</option>
<option value="Jackets">Jackets</option>
<option value="Pants">Pants</option>
<option value="Sportswear">Sportswear</option>
<option value="Streetwear">Streetwear</option>
<option value="Other">Other</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>Quantity<span class="meta"> · 1 design · 1 color · 5 sizes</span></label>
<div aria-label="Quantity range" class="opt-row" role="radiogroup">
<label><input name="moq_tier" type="radio" value="100–500 pcs" checked /><span>100–500 pcs</span></label>
<label><input name="moq_tier" type="radio" value="500–1,000 pcs"/><span>500–1,000 pcs</span></label>
<label><input name="moq_tier" type="radio" value="1,000–2,000 pcs"/><span>1,000–2,000 pcs</span></label>
<label><input name="moq_tier" type="radio" value="2,000+ pcs"/><span>2,000+ pcs</span></label>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field-row">
<div class="field">
<label for="name">Name</label>
<input autocomplete="name" class="input" id="name" name="name" required="" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="email">Email</label>
<input autocomplete="email" class="input" id="email" name="email" required="" type="email"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="project-details">Project details <span style="color:var(--yv-muted)">(optional)</span></label>
<textarea class="textarea" id="project-details" name="message" placeholder="Target market, fabric idea, artwork, labels, packing needs, delivery timeline…"></textarea>
